Hi Mel,

Thanks again for today, it was great to catch-up with you and go through our recommendations.

I can confirm the client agreement has been received back, thank you for doing that so promptly.

You will receive another notification saying the other documents I presented to you today are also now on the portal, with the recommendations contained in the document titled Suitability Report.

We will also post out today some Aviva forms that will require signing and posting back in the return envelope provided.

Appreciate your time today, rest assured that all the next steps are in our hands and we will monitor the situation and keep you updated along the way.

I will be in touch shortly with any updates.

Have a great rest of the week.


Kind Regards,

James Poka MFinPlan DipPFS
Head of Advice

